OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'forgotten' model village
OL,4,Awhere 19th-Century workers escaped
OL,5,Aovercrowded slums
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhile Port Sunlight on the Wirral is a
OL,8,Fwell-known example of an industrial
OL,9,Fmodel village where workers lived to
OL,10,Fescape Victorian slums, another model
OL,11,Fvillage close by actually predates it
OL,12,Fby more than three decades.
OL,14,FBromborough Pool, founded in 1853, is
OL,15,Fless well known than Port Sunlight, and
OL,16,Flocal historian Elizabeth Davey said
OL,17,F"even Wirral residents are not quite
OL,18,Fsure what is there".
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
