OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'forgotten' model village
OL,4,Awhere 19th-Century workers escaped
OL,5,Aovercrowded slums
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe garden village, a planned
OL,8,Fcommunity, was founded by Price's
OL,9,FPatent Candle Factory to enable workers
OL,10,Fto escape overcrowded and
OL,11,Fdisease-ridden industrial slums.
OL,13,FMike Christiansen, who has researched
OL,14,Fits history, said it was a "forgotten
OL,15,Fvillage", despite being the second such
OL,16,Fvillage to be created in Britain.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
